{"id": "305cda298ece", "title": "MLP FIM Season 6 Episode 3 - The Gift of Maud Pie (4과)", "source": "youtube_stream", "source_url": "https://youtu.be/qsuNP6M4J3Y", "status": "ready", "media_file": null, "video_id": "qsuNP6M4J3Y", "segments": [{"start": 978.36, "end": 978.74, "text": "Impressive.", "index": 0}, {"start": 979.52, "end": 980.86, "text": "But it's no fissure in the sidewalk.", "index": 1}, {"start": 982.8, "end": 983.4, "text": "Plain nice.", "index": 2}, {"start": 984.2, "end": 986.4, "text": "Oh, I'm so relieved to see that you like the pouch.", "index": 3}, {"start": 986.4, "end": 989.46, "text": "Especially considering what Pinkie Pie had to give up for it.", "index": 4}, {"start": 990.04, "end": 990.48, "text": "What?", "index": 5}, {"start": 991.8, "end": 996.05, "text": "I don't see that you like the pouch.", "index": 6}, {"start": 996.47, "end": 997.63, "text": "You can remember that part.", "index": 7}, {"start": 998.25, "end": 999.13, "text": "Just forget the second part.", "index": 8}, {"start": 999.57, "end": 1002.59, "text": "You know, the second part where I said that Pinkie Pie had to give something up.", "index": 9}, {"start": 1003.63, "end": 1005.17, "text": "I should just stop talking now.", "index": 10}, {"start": 1005.33, "end": 1005.59, "text": "Nothing.", "index": 11}, {"start": 1012.03, "end": 1013.55, "text": "I said she's using her party cannon.", "index": 12}, {"start": 1014.11, "end": 1045.13, "text": "She gave up her party cannon.", "index": 13}, {"start": 1059.34, "end": 1059.88, "text": "One boat.", "index": 14}, {"start": 1063.24, "end": 1064.66, "text": "You gave away your party cannon.", "index": 15}, {"start": 1067.17, "end": 1068.05, "text": "She broke me.", "index": 16}, {"start": 1085.8, "end": 1087.04, "text": "To get your cannon back.", "index": 17}, {"start": 1103.96, "end": 1104.44, "text": "Mods.", "index": 18}, {"start": 1110.6, "end": 1113.86, "text": "I'd like to return this pouch for my sister's party cannon, please.", "index": 19}, {"start": 1114.68, "end": 1115.56, "text": "Sorry, Missy.", "index": 20}, {"start": 1115.86, "end": 1116.62, "text": "I'll sail to flight.", "index": 21}, {"start": 1117.2, "end": 1121.82, "text": "I'd like to return this pouch for my sister's party cannon, please.", "index": 22}, {"start": 1122.74, "end": 1124.46, "text": "Oh, I've never seen her like this.", "index": 23}, {"start": 1125.04, "end": 1126.66, "text": "Look at the fire in her eyes.", "index": 24}, {"start": 1127.32, "end": 1128.3, "text": "You better do what she says.", "index": 25}, {"start": 1129.0, "end": 1130.1, "text": "Fire in her eyes.", "index": 26}, {"start": 1130.54, "end": 1132.18, "text": "Oh, did she just cleanse her jaw?", "index": 27}, {"start": 1132.64, "end": 1133.84, "text": "I think she cleansed her jaw.", "index": 28}, {"start": 1134.38, "end": 1135.12, "text": "I didn't see.", "index": 29}, {"start": 1136.54, "end": 1137.26, "text": "Oh, no.", "index": 30}, {"start": 1137.26, "end": 1138.76, "text": "But she cleansed her jaw.", "index": 31}, {"start": 1139.34, "end": 1141.54, "text": "You know what that means.", "index": 32}, {"start": 1142.14, "end": 1142.5, "text": "What?", "index": 33}, {"start": 1142.76, "end": 1143.42, "text": "What's it mean?", "index": 34}, {"start": 1143.84, "end": 1144.44, "text": "Trust me.", "index": 35}, {"start": 1147.32, "end": 1148.8, "text": "I'd like to return this pouch.", "index": 36}, {"start": 1151.69, "end": 1152.17, "text": "Take it.", "index": 37}, {"start": 1152.39, "end": 1152.71, "text": "Take it.", "index": 38}, {"start": 1152.93, "end": 1153.11, "text": "Please.", "index": 39}, {"start": 1153.99, "end": 1154.81, "text": "Just relax that jaw.", "index": 40}, {"start": 1155.11, "end": 1157.49, "text": "Yours can turn down that fire in your eyes.", "index": 41}, {"start": 1184.94, "end": 1187.04, "text": "Pinkie, gift giving isn't a competition.", "index": 42}, {"start": 1188.06, "end": 1192.1, "text": "It's an expression of love, and you always make sure to give your gifts with lots of love.", "index": 43}, {"start": 1192.88, "end": 1196.2, "text": "That's why I'll always love them, and you, five ever.", "index": 44}, {"start": 1197.14, "end": 1199.26, "text": "That's even longer than four ever.", "index": 45}, {"start": 1199.5, "end": 1213.72, "text": "The side you two simply must see before we leave.", "index": 46}, {"start": 1221.76, "end": 1227.21, "text": "The future home is the right location.", "index": 47}, {"start": 1227.73, "end": 1227.89, "text": "Do I?", "index": 48}, {"start": 1229.58, "end": 1229.96, "text": "No.", "index": 49}, {"start": 1231.16, "end": 1232.82, "text": "You picked the perfect spot.", "index": 50}, {"start": 1233.34, "end": 1285.86, "text": "For my party cannon.", "index": 51}], "created_at": "2026-08-10T13:33:22.057208+00:00", "duration": 1325, "unit": 4, "unit_total": 4}